@startuml sequence-chatbot

' ========================================================
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - AI Chatbot Interaction
' ========================================================

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    ActorBorderColor #64748b
    LifeLineBorderColor #94a3b8
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #f8fafc
    ParticipantBorderColor #64748b
}

title Sequence Diagram: AI Chatbot Interaction

actor User as U #e0f2fe
participant "StickyChatbot\n(React Component)" as Chat #fef3c7
participant "Next.js API\n/api/chat" as API #d1fae5
database "Knowledge Base" as KB #f0abfc
participant "Google Gemini AI" as Gemini #fce7f3

== Open Chat ==

U -> Chat : Klik floating chat button
activate Chat

Chat -> Chat : Load history dari localStorage
Chat -> Chat : Tampilkan chat window

alt First Visit
    Chat --> U : Tampilkan welcome message\n+ suggested questions
else Returning User
    Chat --> U : Tampilkan previous conversation
end

== Send Message ==

U -> Chat : Ketik pertanyaan
U -> Chat : Tekan Enter / klik Send
activate Chat

Chat -> Chat : Tambah message ke state
Chat --> U : Tampilkan user message
Chat --> U : Tampilkan typing indicator

Chat -> API : POST /api/chat\n{message: "pertanyaan user"}
activate API

API -> KB : Fetch knowledge base entries
KB --> API : Knowledge articles

API -> API : Build context prompt
Note right of API
  Context includes:
  - System instructions
  - Knowledge base content
  - Conversation history
  - User's question
end note

API -> Gemini : POST generateContent\n{prompt, context}
activate Gemini

Gemini -> Gemini : Process with AI
Gemini --> API : Generated response
deactivate Gemini

API -> API : Format response (Markdown)
API --> Chat : {response: "AI answer"}
deactivate API

Chat -> Chat : Sembunyikan typing indicator
Chat -> Chat : Tambah AI response ke state
Chat --> U : Tampilkan AI response\n(rendered Markdown)

Chat -> Chat : Simpan ke localStorage
deactivate Chat

== Continue Conversation ==

U -> Chat : Ketik pertanyaan lanjutan
Note right of U: Loop repeats with\nconversation history

== Escalate to Human ==

U -> Chat : Klik "Hubungi Kami"
Chat --> U : Redirect ke /contact
Chat -> Chat : Pre-fill form dengan context

@enduml
